<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Captain John L - 60,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Liverpool $8.90 fio scale load/25,000 shinc early Feb NSAC.</p>
<p>ORE - Lika - 110,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba/Ijmuiden approx. $7 fio six days shinc 1-8/2 Hoogovens.</p>
<p>Lassia - 130,000 tonnes ore Saldanha/Beilun $8.50 fio scale load/20,000 shinc mid Feb Chinese charterers (ammended).</p>
</text>
